Update bundled MuJS runtime to 1.3.11.

Modified by Mervin PDF on 2026-11-04.
Upstream https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/mujs/compare/1.3.10...1.3.11
Preserve MuPDF build integration. Mervin does not enable PDF JavaScript.
Also correct the upstream array rollback loop to delete index k, not i.
Fault injection confirms 1.3.11 otherwise retains migrated array values
after allocation failure, even after the application removes those values.

